Package: phoenix-theme
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Phoenix OS Project <build@phoenix-os.io>
Depends: plasma-desktop, breeze, kvantum
Recommends: papirus-icon-theme
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Phoenix OS KDE Plasma Theme
 Visual theme package for Phoenix OS including:
  - KDE Plasma color scheme (Phoenix Dark)
  - Kvantum Qt theme
  - SDDM login theme
  - GRUB theme
  - Plymouth boot splash theme
  - KDE global settings defaults
